Run the package development loop, or stand up the environment it needs

Usage: wamn dev [OPTIONS] --config <FILE> --overlay-root <DIRECTORY>
       wamn dev <COMMAND>

Commands:
  up    Stand up the disposable environment the loop runs against, and hold it
  help  Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
      --config <FILE>
          Strict deployment configuration document

      --overlay-root <DIRECTORY>
          Package root for the application overlay under development

      --watch
          Keep the disposable verification session open and rerun affected suffixes

      --hold
          Keep the activated release reachable until this process is interrupted.
          
          Session mode and renderer are independent axes. This is the session mode the interactive client already uses, offered to the plain renderer: redundant under --tui, and a no-op under --watch, which holds by its own nature.

      --tui
          Render the development session in the interactive terminal client

  -h, --help
          Print help (see a summary with '-h')
